{"summary":"Sky-high stunts with colossal vehicles! Can you dominate the heights?","description":"Welcome to 'Heavy Duty Stunt Racing', the game where construction meets reckless aerial acrobatics! Who ever said heavy machinery couldn't fly? Jump behind the wheel of colossal vehicles like dump trucks, 6-wheeled cranes, armored transporters, and more. Your job? To race through the sky-high tracks, bursting with jumps and challenges, all while the laws of physics shake their head in disbelief. Each attempt is a wild ride, with earnings to boot. Upgrade your machine's power, its gravity-defying capabilities, or the cash you earn. The sky (literally) is the limit! Dive into a thrilling world where massive vehicles dance in the air. Remember, size doesn't matter when you have enough horsepower and a ramp ahead. Ready to redefine aerodynamics with a bulldozer? Buckle up!\n\nIGRS rating: 13+","esrbNotes":"Mild Violence","pegiNotes":"Strong Violence","iapPrices":"$1.99 - $29.99 per item","video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/oRyCdo1cte8?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_7AYoEUWfdeE7hogbbw1iKJm3OM7Qqo_vKnPewVzRLOUGXaMAixG8OUd4MpXaXXHnZKK1ea4TJbzcfb9OVhZMQ","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/7jP-ciN6KAt0ew2wz1tnlqCb8hMJPMnvnDu5bnNED2taAFw8xagQJwC6AW70QegDwM9Z_boBSYj23DFxMafPeg","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Lk-cV5H0a_lPjpO7DWa6HcZs7SVN8DoxwJ5PGrjgZdSxHPgno91eVWWu3RdHKNI_E0flSJw1B3y7cxD9Xu956w","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Pr6dwSC7FLjx9Ogv7VxdsmQlzmBq6kXL9TREcssXGDcuNkEOPnGxSp2KPael3cnkefcioL5rJqNyodqr-Cmj","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/HuP2k_MwG24wO7vxVdsXRYiN8TTEuUntrvsKAC0fEKXfFcp6L73fGj3kZLt2cRox6l1hIfWGGyj7ZLqO8sttHA","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/smIzxb4gvbzAAi7fqsXNkiNRzG4j0UhxNVzzhxuROC54v8H2FRRZXp6Pqf_KbknGW_lh_Wrunn1f7bglAvvSuw","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/RfuxqxUHBZTwT1tTtw0QhmSPQvNJKJGzl8LNaHjrLaT2js35PBEsqI7cUD_C68nTD6bRolkG39Ah3odYxnvZXgE","htt